steps.text:
A hard ride or run upsets the inside of each working fibre. Four changes stand out:

- **calcium** (Ca²⁺) floods out with every contraction;
- **ATP falls** a little and AMP builds up;
- **[reactive oxygen species](g:reactive-oxygen-species)** (ROS) rise;
- the fibre is **stretched** and squeezed.

The cell senses each change through a [signalling pathway](g:signalling-pathway): a chain of molecules, each switching on the next, that ends by changing which genes are read ([gene expression](g:gene-expression)) [[c:sig-network]].

So the session itself doesn't make you fitter. It sends a message; the fibre's answer, over the following hours, is to build more of what it was short of [[c:sig-remodel]].
